{"3253480": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Trials of Enkidu", "steam_appid": 3253480, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Trials of Enkidu</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Die. Learn. Adapt. DOMINATE.<br><br>Tasked with retrieving the Eternal Lotus for his king and dear friend, Gilgamesh, join the fearless warrior Enkidu as he finds himself displaced in time, inadvertently bonded to the very power he swore to deliver to the king.<br><br>In <strong>The</strong> <strong>Trials </strong>of <strong>Enkidu</strong>, you will need to learn your foes strengths and weaknesses, and discover powerful counters if you are to prevail and return to your own time, while also uncovering the mysteries of the Eternal Lotus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trials </strong>of <strong>Enkidu</strong> combines  fast-paced combat, build-crafting, and strategic planning in a top-down, 2D pixel-art world filled with gothic steampunk influences. Experience vast, haunting environments, from ancient ruins to twisted forests, while mastering unique skills, weaponry, and alliances to overcome the <strong>trials</strong> before you. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Key Features:</strong></u>  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Dynamic Combat System: Engage in intense, tactical combat that rewards skill and strategy. Master a wide array of weapons and abilities to exploit enemy strengths and weaknesses as you face mythological creatures, enemy factions, and even your closest allies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Recruit companions to fight alongside you as you traverse a world filled with myth, villains, and legends, shaping your destiny and that of the Eternal Lotus. Companions can also harness the power of the Lotus, allowing you to increase their power and effectiveness in combat. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > • Factions &amp; Politics: Join or oppose powerful factions like the Kin of Ki, the Domen Shogunate, or the fanatical Agni Covenant. Aligning with the various factions open up even more strategic options as you overcome the challenges of the Land of Expanse.<br>• Develop Bonds With A Complex Cast of Characters: Form bonds with your companions and others you meet along your journey. Increasing your relationships may reward you with unique Gear, Lotus Shards, and abilities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Character Customization: Customize <strong>Enkidu</strong>’s abilities and equipment to suit your playstyle. Will you embrace raw power, or focus on cunning strategy? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Dramatic Aesthetic: Dive into a visually stunning world influenced by classical, gothic, steampunk, and futuristic styles, with atmospheric 2D pixel art that brings the game’s unique settings and characters to life. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Trials</strong> Await: Cross deserts, scale mountains, and descend into the heart of darkness as you face <strong>trials</strong> that will push you beyond your limits. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you emerge victorious, or be consumed by the myth? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to face the <strong>Trials </strong>of <strong>Enkidu</strong>?</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Trials of Enkidu</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Die. Learn. Adapt. DOMINATE.<br><br>Tasked with retrieving the Eternal Lotus for his king and dear friend, Gilgamesh, join the fearless warrior Enkidu as he finds himself displaced in time, inadvertently bonded to the very power he swore to deliver to the king.<br><br>In <strong>The</strong> <strong>Trials </strong>of <strong>Enkidu</strong>, you will need to learn your foes strengths and weaknesses, and discover powerful counters if you are to prevail and return to your own time, while also uncovering the mysteries of the Eternal Lotus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trials </strong>of <strong>Enkidu</strong> combines  fast-paced combat, build-crafting, and strategic planning in a top-down, 2D pixel-art world filled with gothic steampunk influences. Experience vast, haunting environments, from ancient ruins to twisted forests, while mastering unique skills, weaponry, and alliances to overcome the <strong>trials</strong> before you. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Key Features:</strong></u>  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Dynamic Combat System: Engage in intense, tactical combat that rewards skill and strategy. Master a wide array of weapons and abilities to exploit enemy strengths and weaknesses as you face mythological creatures, enemy factions, and even your closest allies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Recruit companions to fight alongside you as you traverse a world filled with myth, villains, and legends, shaping your destiny and that of the Eternal Lotus. Companions can also harness the power of the Lotus, allowing you to increase their power and effectiveness in combat. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > • Factions &amp; Politics: Join or oppose powerful factions like the Kin of Ki, the Domen Shogunate, or the fanatical Agni Covenant. Aligning with the various factions open up even more strategic options as you overcome the challenges of the Land of Expanse.<br>• Develop Bonds With A Complex Cast of Characters: Form bonds with your companions and others you meet along your journey. Increasing your relationships may reward you with unique Gear, Lotus Shards, and abilities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Character Customization: Customize <strong>Enkidu</strong>’s abilities and equipment to suit your playstyle. Will you embrace raw power, or focus on cunning strategy? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Dramatic Aesthetic: Dive into a visually stunning world influenced by classical, gothic, steampunk, and futuristic styles, with atmospheric 2D pixel art that brings the game’s unique settings and characters to life. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Trials</strong> Await: Cross deserts, scale mountains, and descend into the heart of darkness as you face <strong>trials</strong> that will push you beyond your limits. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you emerge victorious, or be consumed by the myth? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to face the <strong>Trials </strong>of <strong>Enkidu</strong>?</p>", "short_description": "Join Enkidu on his retro-inspired, fast-paced action RPG quest! This era-spanning adventure will test your reflexes, strategic thinking, build crafting, and resolve as you battle waves of increasingly difficult armies. Defy fate and protect the Eternal Lotus, or watch the world wilt and wither!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253480/6d41e345f68f54fc24bf6b2b496c0c28bc52dd2c/header.jpg?t=1772808969", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253480/9e7c4e64a1d6da1843cd202d457ad2452bbea901/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772808969", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253480/9e7c4e64a1d6da1843cd202d457ad2452bbea901/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772808969", "website": "http://www.trialsofenkidu.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 x64<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-2500K / AMD Athlon X4 860K<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 750 / Radeon R7 260X<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8600K / AMD Ryzen 5 2600X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1060 / Radeon RX 5500 XT<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor. </li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "legal_notice": "Developed and Published by LA2079.<br />\r\nLA2079 and the LA2079 Logo are Trademarks of LA2079. All Rights Reserved.<br />\r\nThe Trials of Enkidu and the Trials of Enkidu Logo are Trademarks of LA2079. All Rights Reserved.", "developers": ["LA2079"], "publishers": ["Keyan Group Inc"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"id": 28, "description": "Full controller support"}, {"id": 13, "description": "Captions available"}, {"id": 67, "description": "Camera Comfort"}, {"id": 68, "description": "Custom Volume Controls"}, {"id": 74, "description": "Playable without Timed Input"}, {"id": 55, "description": "DualShock Controller Support"}, {"id": 56, "description": "DualShock Controller Support"}, {"id": 57, "description": "DualSense Controller Support"}, {"id": 58, "description": "DualSense Controller Support"}, {"id": 79, "description": "Save Anytime"}, {"id": 69, "description": "Stereo Sound"}, {"id": 65, "description": "Subtitle Options"}, {"id": 70, "description": "Surround Sound"}, {"id": 23, "description": "Steam Cloud"}, {"id": 15, "description": "Stats"}, {"id": 25, "description": "Steam Leaderboards"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}, {"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}, {"id": "3", "description": "RPG"}, {"id": "70", "description": "Early Access"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253480/7c9bb9a9a6d811452a3203beb2c0b0b